{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07002","headline":"出萧关怀古 · 陶翰","name":"出萧关怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱马击长劒，行役至萧关。\n悠悠五原上，永眺关河前。\n北虏三十万，此中常控弦。\n秦城亘宇宙，汉帝理旌旃。\n刁斗鸣不息，羽书日夜传。\n五军计莫就，三策议空全。\n大漠横万里，萧条绝人烟。\n孤城当瀚海，落日照[祁]连。\n怆矣苦寒奏，怀哉式微篇。\n更悲秦楼月，夜夜出胡天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}